{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/02/18/7048551/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/02/18/7048551/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は、毎日みんなでライブのリハ\n頑張ってます*\\(^o^)/*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"覚えることいっぱい！頭ん中ぎゅうぎゅう！ ん～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/02/18/7048551/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"約7時間半って、改めてすごいライブですよね(´×ω×`)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、それだけ曲も増えて乃木坂が大きくなってきた証拠なんだなあ～\nって感じます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までの楽曲を全て披露するので、\n時々、ああこれ懐かしいなあー って\n思ったりしながらリハしてます(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんも、そんな感じで、ライブ楽しんでくれたら嬉しいなー♪\n楽しみっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、これだけ長いと、体力もそうだけど\nなんせ寒さが心配です(=ω= ;)ぅ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだお仕事で、極寒での撮影があったんですが、\nそのときの凍える私の必死な姿を\nいまだにめっちゃスタッフさんから笑われます（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなに、小さい百合の花ーって言われながら温められてました（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"多分、めっちゃ面白い光景だったろうな...って\n思い出すと自分でも笑っちゃうけど（笑）\nほんとに寒さには弱いから、\n西武ドームがこわくて仕方ないです（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうか2月22日が、ポカポカ陽気になりますように！神さまー！（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんも、いっぱいいっぱい防寒してきてくださいね(｡> <｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"関東だからって甘くちゃいけないぞー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"埼玉なめんなよっ٩(๑ˆˆ๑)۶ 笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊ 2/15"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(   1stアルバム 『透明な色』\n発売記念スペシャル個別握手会   )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部 : おいでシャンプー\n2部 : ぐるぐるカーテン\n3部 : ガールズルール"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都の皆さん、有難う。\nのぎ天見て下さった方も有難う＾＾"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/02/18/7048551/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガールズルールは、こないだも着たんだけど\n今回は、自分のと違うデザインのを着てみました( ^ω^ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは、かずみんの！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/02/18/7048551/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ、ずっと着てみたかったのっo(^o^)oわーい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、新制服も解禁されました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼  じゃんっ   ／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/02/18/7048551/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クラシカルな感じで可愛い！\n衣装さん有難う～( ˆoˆ )bｸﾞｯ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色んな撮影もしたのでお楽しみに！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊  2/17"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちーちゃん、\nお誕生日おめでとう(﹡ˆoˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"18歳かぁ～早いねぇ～。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも、鼻と鼻をくっつけてお話するほど距離が近くなれた私たちだけど、\n優しくて面白いちーちゃんが\nこれからも大好きだよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この季節は、あったかい飲み物が\n飲みたくなるね～(  *^_^*  )○゜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、せいたんからココアを貰って飲みました(#^.^#)きゅん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、その後、ゆったんが買ってきてくれたアイスを食べちゃいました。\n...(´^ω^`)あれ？おかしいぞ、結局寒いぞー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オフモード（笑）"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/02/18/7048551/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/02/18/7048551/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/02/18/7048551/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/02/18/7048551/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆヽ(｡･ω･｡)正義"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/02/18/7048551/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}